{
  "name": "harnu",
  "version": "0.3.46-t389.1",
  "description": "Harnu — manage every Claude Code session in one place. A desktop GUI for Claude Code.",
  "main": "./out/main/index.js",
  "author": "Junielton",
  "homepage": "https://harnu.dev",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/junielton/harnu.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/junielton/harnu/issues"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "claude",
    "claude-code",
    "electron",
    "vue",
    "terminal",
    "session-manager",
    "ai"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "format": "prettier --write .",
    "format:check": "prettier --check .",
    "sweep": "bash scripts/worktree-sweep.sh",
    "lint": "eslint --cache .",
    "typecheck:node": "tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.node.json --composite false",
    "typecheck:web": "vue-tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.web.json --composite false",
    "typecheck": "npm run typecheck:node && npm run typecheck:web",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "test:watch": "vitest",
    "verify:voice-licence": "node scripts/ci/voice-licence-gate.mjs",
    "test:coverage": "vitest run --coverage",
    "e2e": "playwright test --project=smoke",
    "e2e:ci": "playwright test --project=ci",
    "eval:mission": "vite-node scripts/eval/mission-behavior/run.mjs --",
    "start": "electron-vite preview",
    "dev": "electron-vite dev -- --remote-debugging-port=9222 --disable-gpu",
    "build": "npm run typecheck && electron-vite build",
    "postinstall": "electron-builder install-app-deps",
    "prepare": "husky || true",
    "build:unpack": "npm run build && electron-builder --dir",
    "build:win": "npm run build && electron-builder --win",
    "build:mac": "npm run build && electron-builder --mac",
    "build:linux": "npm run build && electron-builder --linux"
  },
  "lint-staged": {
    "*": "prettier --write --ignore-unknown",
    "src/renderer/src/i18n/*.json": [
      "prettier --write",
      "node scripts/ci/i18n-parity.mjs"
    ]
  },
  "dependencyNotes": {
    "@antv/x6": [
      "PINNED, and the pin is load-bearing — do not bump without re-verifying (T218, spec docs/specs/2026-08-23-t218-canvas-pane.md §3.4).",
      "package.json is strict JSON and cannot carry a comment, so the reason lives here, next to the dependency site, rather than nowhere.",
      "1. X6 core 3.x has NO working plugin ecosystem: the 2.x plugins throw `TypeError: t.View.dispose is not a function` against it (3.x removed the disposable-decorator API they compile against).",
      "2. The published 3.0.0 plugin packages are empty stubs — each ships CSS and ZERO .js files, so they cannot be used at all.",
      "3. The plugins' npm `latest` dist-tag still points at 2.x, so `npm i @antv/x6@latest @antv/x6-plugin-selection` silently produces the BROKEN 3.x-core + 2.x-plugin pairing.",
      "The failure mode is a canvas pane that renders nodes but has no selection, no undo, no resize and no snaplines — which reads as a bug in our code, not a dependency mismatch.",
      "Treat core 3.x as unusable until AntV republishes real 3.x plugins. `tests/canvas-pane-render.test.ts` asserts all four plugins actually load (U2-5), so a bump that breaks them fails a test instead of shipping."
    ]
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@antv/x6": "2.19.2",
    "@antv/x6-plugin-history": "2.2.4",
    "@antv/x6-plugin-selection": "2.2.2",
    "@antv/x6-plugin-snapline": "2.1.7",
    "@antv/x6-plugin-transform": "2.1.8",
    "@electron-toolkit/preload": "^3.0.2",
    "@electron-toolkit/utils": "^4.0.0",
    "@modelcontextprotocol/sdk": "^1.29.0",
    "@vueuse/core": "^14.3.0",
    "@xterm/addon-image": "^0.9.0",
    "@xterm/addon-web-links": "^0.12.0",
    "@xterm/xterm": "^6.0.0",
    "chokidar": "^5.0.0",
    "dompurify": "^3.4.11",
    "electron-updater": "^6.8.9",
    "fuse.js": "^7.4.2",
    "ignore": "^7.0.6",
    "lowlight": "^3.3.0",
    "lucide-vue-next": "^1.0.0",
    "markdown-it": "^14.3.0",
    "node-pty": "^1.1.0",
    "pinia": "^3.0.4",
    "vue-i18n": "^11.4.6",
    "zod": "^4.4.3"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@electron-toolkit/eslint-config-prettier": "3.0.0",
    "@electron-toolkit/eslint-config-ts": "^3.1.0",
    "@electron-toolkit/tsconfig": "^2.0.0",
    "@playwright/test": "^1.61.1",
    "@tailwindcss/vite": "^4.3.2",
    "@types/markdown-it": "^14.1.2",
    "@types/node": "^26.1.1",
    "@vitejs/plugin-vue": "^6.0.2",
    "@vitest/coverage-v8": "^2.1.9",
    "@vue/test-utils": "^2.4.11",
    "electron": "^39.2.6",
    "electron-builder": "^26.15.3",
    "electron-vite": "^5.0.0",
    "eslint": "^10.7.0",
    "eslint-plugin-vue": "^10.9.2",
    "husky": "^9.1.7",
    "jsdom": "^29.1.1",
    "lint-staged": "^17.0.8",
    "pixelmatch": "^7.2.0",
    "playwright-core": "^1.60.0",
    "pngjs": "^7.0.0",
    "prettier": "^3.9.5",
    "tailwindcss": "^4.3.0",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3",
    "vite": "^7.2.6",
    "vitest": "^2.1.9",
    "vue": "^3.5.39",
    "vue-eslint-parser": "^10.4.1",
    "vue-tsc": "^3.3.7"
  }
}
